prompt_template:
The current directory is a checkout of the abapGit repository (ABAP sources in abapGit file format under src/). List every method that calls {target}, defined in {defined_in}. Include callers in local classes and in unit test classes. For each call give the calling method, the file path relative to the repository root, and the 1-based line number of the call.

End your reply with a single JSON object and nothing after it:
{{"callers": [{{"method": "<class>-><method>", "file": "src/...", "line": 123}}]}}
